Package: cosTapered
Type: Package
Title: Tapered Change-of-Support Spatial Response Models
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andrew O.", "Finley", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "finleya@msu.edu"),
    person("Lu", "Zhang", role = "aut"),
    person("Arne", "Nothdurft", role = "aut"),
    person("Sudipto", "Banerjee", role = "aut"),
    person("Arthur", "Spitta", role = "ctb", email = "arthur.spitta@students.boku.ac.at")
    )
Description: Lightweight implementation of Bayesian change-of-support
    spatial models for polygon-support observations, fine-support raster
    covariates, and areal prediction targets. The Gaussian response model
    follows Zhang et al. (2024) <doi:10.1016/j.jag.2024.104224>, with
    experimental Polya-Gamma paths for binomial and fixed-size
    negative-binomial responses.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://finleya.github.io/cosTapered/, https://github.com/finleya/cosTapered
BugReports: https://github.com/finleya/cosTapered/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: sf, raster, exactextractr, Matrix, methods, BayesLogit (>= 2.4)
LinkingTo: BayesLogit (>= 2.4)
Suggests: ggplot2, knitr, quarto, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr, quarto
